{
  "_README": [
    "Hand-authored model data. scripts/extract-plans.mjs turns the PDFs in",
    "assets-src/plans/ into images using the `pages` list below, and",
    "scripts/build-plans.mjs generates plans/index.html and plans/<slug>.html.",
    "",
    "Page roles come from each PDF's document outline ('The Poet-Foundation'),",
    "read by scripts/scaffold-plans.mjs. That outline is the one machine-readable",
    "label in these files that can be trusted. The printed sheet titles cannot:",
    "the brochures carry leftover hidden content layers that pdftoppm does not",
    "render but pdftotext still returns, so extracted text names the wrong sheet.",
    "the-maestro and the-visionary have no outline at all, so their page order was",
    "read off the rendered pages. So were all sixteen elevation captions, which are",
    "not in the outline either.",
    "",
    "`id` also names the output file: plans/img/<slug>-<id>.{webp,png}. The crop is",
    "measured per page - extract-plans.mjs keeps the tallest block of ink, which is",
    "always the drawing - so no band needs tuning. An optional `band` [top, bottom]",
    "as a fraction of page height overrides that for one page if it is ever needed.",
    "",
    "An elevation's `label` is the caption printed under the rendering. That caption",
    "is deliberately cropped OUT of the image (Leavitt asked for it off the site),",
    "so the label survives only as the image's alt text.",
    "",
    "Models are listed in the order they appear at /plans/: alphabetical by the",
    "name after 'The'.",
    "",
    "Specs come from Leavitt's own figures and NOTHING here may be guessed.",
    "`sqft` is living square footage; `sqftFrom` true means their sheet said",
    "'starting at', which the page renders as 'From 2,626'. `baths` is null because",
    "no bath counts were supplied, and the pages render an honest 'On request' for",
    "it. `stories` is observable from the plan set - no second-floor sheet means a",
    "single-story house."
  ],
